/* Templates round 29: New Leaf's product page, after the owner's reference, drawn from the product itself: a dark band with a strip of the product's cover art, the way back to its category and its icon; the theme's own product information (title, the description's first paragraphs, price, a Get it button that goes to checkout and three ticks) beside the product's second picture; What's inside, one row per Heading 3 in the description with the product's next pictures; three columns of what every template has; a band to buy it; and more templates from the same category. */
